        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Passage Function Lever for Global Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Passage Function Lever (Non Locking) for use with <a href=\"/products/exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-al\"><b>Global ED-501-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/dark-bronze-exit-door-locks-global-ed-501-du\"><b>Global ED-501-DU</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-al\"><b>Global ED-VR531-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/dark-bronze-surface-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-ed-vr531-du\"><b>Global ED-VR531-DU</b></a>,  \r\n<a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\"><b>Global ED-501ALARM-AL</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/surface-vertical-rod-alarm-exit-device-global-ed-vr531alarm-al\"><b>Global ED-VR531ALARM-AL</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWill fit a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole. Removable studs so it works with doors prepared with and with out commercial thru-bolt holes. Packaged with mounting hardware\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global ED-LHL510 Passage Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Passage - Entry by turning lever. Non locking.</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b> or <b>Dark Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preps</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant Door Hardware</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
